      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the clinic veterinarians and nursing staff for their warmth, attentiveness, and reassuring presence during urgent pet visits. Pet owners value clear medical updates and calm guidance when arriving in distress with a sick or injured pet. A few isolated reviews voice dissatisfaction with clinical decisions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle pet comfort during emergencies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently commend the staff for their patient, gentle handling of frightened or painful animals during urgent appointments. Clients note that the team takes extra care to soothe distressed dogs and cats, administering treatments smoothly and minimizing clinic anxiety. Two reviewers reported negative handling experiences."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt triage and efficient urgent intake"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the facility's accessible urgent care model, noting quick check-in times and prompt triage for walk-in medical emergencies. Many clients report being taken back into exam rooms immediately without the prolonged waiting typical of traditional emergency veterinary hospitals."
      }
    }
  ],
